<title>POLAND: Polish Jan food price data next week - Statoffice.</title>
<headline>Polish Jan food price data next week - Statoffice.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-01-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Poland's Central Statistical Office (GUS) will early next week release food price data for the month of January, a senior official said.</p>
<p>The official said annual changes in baskets and sampling groups caused a delay in the release of data for the January 1-20 period, but the schedule would get back on track starting from February.</p>
<p>GUS releases food price growth after every 10-day period.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
